  "description": "Create soft, warm, and charming designs with this Boho Nursery Baby Shower Pattern Collection. Featuring gentle boho elements, neutral color palettes, and baby-themed illustrations, this bundle is perfect for nursery décor, baby shower stationery, and children’s creative projects.\nEach pattern is carefully designed with a clean seamless repeat, making it ideal for fabric, wallpaper, and print-on-demand products. The bohemian aesthetic combined with nursery-friendly details brings a cozy, modern, and timeless feel to your designs.\n👉 You will receive a total of 35 seamless patterns, all high-resolution and fully tileable for professional-quality results.\nWhat’s Included\n– 35 High-resolution seamless patterns\n– File format: JPEG (high resolution)\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px\n– Seamless and tileable for large-scale printing\n– Boho nursery and baby shower–inspired designs\n– Fully editable: resize, rotate, recolor, or layer as needed\nKey Features\n– Soft boho nursery and baby shower aesthetic\n– Seamless repeating pattern format\n– High-resolution quality for print and digital use\n– Neutral, warm, and calming color palette\n– Easy to customize for different creative needs\nPerfect For\n– Baby shower invitations and décor\n– Nursery wall art and accessories\n– Fabric, textile, and wallpaper projects\n– Wrapping paper and gift packaging\n– Scrapbooking and memory books\n– Planner covers and stationery\n– Print-on-demand baby products\n– Seamless pattern and digital paper use\nNote\nThis is a digital product. No physical items will be shipped.\nColors may vary slightly depending on monitor and printer settings.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Create soft, warm, and charming designs with this Boho Nursery Baby Shower Pattern Collection. Featuring gentle boho elements, neutral color palettes, and baby-themed illustrations, this bundle is perfect for nursery décor, baby shower stationery, and children’s creative projects.</p>\n<p>Each pattern is carefully designed with a clean seamless repeat, making it ideal for fabric, wallpaper, and print-on-demand products. The bohemian aesthetic combined with nursery-friendly details brings a cozy, modern, and timeless feel to your designs.</p>\n<p>👉 You will receive a total of 35 seamless patterns, all high-resolution and fully tileable for professional-quality results.</p>\n<p>What’s Included</p>\n<p>– 35 High-resolution seamless patterns<br>\n– File format: JPEG (high resolution)<br>\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px<br>\n– Seamless and tileable for large-scale printing<br>\n– Boho nursery and baby shower–inspired designs<br>\n– Fully editable: resize, rotate, recolor, or layer as needed</p>\n<p>Key Features</p>\n<p>– Soft boho nursery and baby shower aesthetic<br>\n– Seamless repeating pattern format<br>\n– High-resolution quality for print and digital use<br>\n– Neutral, warm, and calming color palette<br>\n– Easy to customize for different creative needs</p>\n<p>Perfect For</p>\n<p>– Baby shower invitations and décor<br>\n– Nursery wall art and accessories<br>\n– Fabric, textile, and wallpaper projects<br>\n– Wrapping paper and gift packaging<br>\n– Scrapbooking and memory books<br>\n– Planner covers and stationery<br>\n– Print-on-demand baby products<br>\n– Seamless pattern and digital paper use</p>\n<p>Note</p>\n<p>This is a digital product. No physical items will be shipped.<br>\nColors may vary slightly depending on monitor and printer settings.</p>",
